    "note": "Prose, then <function=...> with parameters, then a stray </tool_call> with no opener; no toolUse block in the reply. The closing tag was not preceded by an opening one. Declined by owner rule (Q28, 2026-11-10): the whole reply must be calls, so prose before or after the calls leaves the reply as text. It was a positive that expected 1 call(s) and the text \"To find all TODO comments in the `src` directory, I will use the `grep` command to search for lines containing \\\"TODO\\\" within the directory. The command will be executed recursively to ensure all subdirectories are included.\\n\\n\"; the nudge (core/util/toolDialectLeak.ts) still counts the leaked call."
